  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0-beta.2: Testing.On(browser) for a browser created with settings (remote grid, extra arguments); AndAlso() also after a check; HTML report named per test (VAF_Log_test_yyyy-MM-dd_HH-mm-ss.html); the message of a failed element or section check is in the HTML report; a .NET 5-9 project stops at build with error VAF0001 instead of failing at run time; tested with Chrome and Firefox. 3.0.0-beta.1:.NET 10 alongside .NET Framework 4.7.2; no test framework dependency (failed checks throw VafAssertionException; works with NUnit 3 and 4, MSTest and xUnit); only Selenium as a dependency; settings from VAF_* environment variables or app.config. Breaking: BrowserStack, the mobile types, WinFormApplication and InternetExplorer are removed; the MSTest v1 screenshot overload is replaced by LetsSaveScreenshotTo. See \"Migrating from 2.x\" in the README.",
